---
/**
 * SheetIndex.astro: the mount point for the sheet index (city-streaming P5). Renders ONE empty host; the chip, the index plate (desktop)
 * and the bottom sheet (phone) are built by src/scripts/climate-engine/streaming-host/sheet-index-view.ts from the generated sheet table,
 * so a change in how many sheets ship changes nothing here.
 *
 * NOT RENDERED BY ANY PAGE YET (phase P5 adds a surface, not a wiring). To wire it (P3b), place `<SheetIndex />` in the stage chrome for a
 * tiled city only, add `@import './screens/sheet-index.css';` to src/styles/obos-v2/screens.css, and in the page script:
 *
 *   import { mountSheetIndex } (the view, in streaming-host/) and { indexStateOf, selectEventOf } (the model, in streaming/);
 *   add this file's one importer to ALLOWED in tests/unit/streaming-dormant.test.mjs.
 *   const ui = mountSheetIndex(document.querySelector('[data-sheet-index]')!, {
 *     onSelect: (code) => carryOut(manager.dispatch(selectEventOf(code, performance.now()))),
 *   });
 *   // after EVERY dispatch (and once after `start`):
 *   ui.update(indexStateOf(manager.state()));
 */
---
<div class="si-host" data-sheet-index></div>
